From 1d1a82ee006e0d502c6c060712f3a523ffce44f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: snap-pea <snap-pea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:14:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] spec: port probabilistic MTP drafting with rejection
 verify (upstream #27694)

Opt-in via --spec-draft-sampling probabilistic; the fast top-k path re-weights its 10 candidates at the target temperature. Measured neutral-to-worse on the agent bench (45.1 at p-min 0.8 vs 45.4 greedy), so it stays off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
